# Two Agonasaur Rex cycled. Turn 1: the first targets Bot1's own Smuggler's Copter, a Vehicle that is not a creature (it still gets two +1/+1
# counters and trample and indestructible). Turn 3: the second targets Bot2's Llanowar Elves, an opponent's creature (CR 115.1: any creature, not only
# one's own), and only one target is taken (two at once, the Elves and the Copter, are refused); the keywords on the Copter are gone and its counters stay. Turn 5: a third cycling with no target ("up to one") still draws (the
# cycling ability and its trigger are separate, 702.29a) and adds no counters anywhere (the earlier two stay).

